## Interface: 120007, 120100, 120105
## Title: SaltyM+Helper
## Notes: Tracks your party's key cooldowns (interrupts, defensives, brez, Lust) for Mythic+. Attaches to nameplates or party frames, auto-syncs with other users, works with BigWigs, EllesmereUI and the KiraUI plugin.
## Author: Salty
## Version: 1.11.0
## IconTexture: Interface\AddOns\SaltyMPlusHelper\Media\logo.tga
## AddonCompartmentFunc: SaltyMPlusHelper_OnAddonCompartmentClick
## AddonCompartmentFuncOnEnter: SaltyMPlusHelper_OnAddonCompartmentEnter
## AddonCompartmentFuncOnLeave: SaltyMPlusHelper_OnAddonCompartmentLeave
## OptionalDeps: BigWigs, EllesmereUI, ElvUI, Cell, Grid2, KiraUI-Plugin, MythicDungeonTools
## SavedVariables: SaltyMPlusHelperDB
## SavedVariablesPerCharacter: SaltyMPlusHelperCharDB

